{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017145749191-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017162815\"/><p>消防趕至把火救熄。</p><p>今午(17日)2時52分，有途人報案，指將軍澳駿才街77號無綫電視城對開有物件起火。消防接報到場，發現上址垃圾站有垃圾起火燃燒，於是開喉將火救熄。經初步調查，相信無人受傷，毋須疏散，起火原因待查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T09:18:48.113000+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T06:57:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T13:37:50.862472+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T09:17:40.433757+00:00","content_hash":"532912471514c573b7bd6ae4c4fec5b2715a233da66158aaa848caaaf164d250","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}